        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/standpoint> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/versions> ;
    gmeow:sliceConsumer "The unified observation stance: every measured, claimed, or sensed value in any slice; the claim layer (GraphRAG provenance design)."@x-gmeow-english.
